namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIInputModeLibrary {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputModeLibrary.h#DreamUIInputModeLibrary
    src   "Input mode and cursor control, addressed by DreamGUI's user index rather than by a raw controller.\n\nEverything here is a thin, honest wrapper over APlayerController: the engine owns input modes and\nthe cursor, and a UI plugin that tried to own them too would be the thing a project fights with.\nWhat the wrapper adds is the user index -- the same index an event system, a pointer and a\nraycaster all speak -- so that a split-screen game does not have to rediscover which controller a\ngiven piece of UI belongs to at every call site."
    text  "输入模式与光标控制，通过DreamGUI的用户索引寻址，而非直接使用原始控制器。\n\n这里的一切都是对APlayerController的轻量而忠实的封装：输入模式和光标\n由引擎掌管，而一个试图同时掌管它们的UI插件，只会成为项目处处对抗的对象。\n封装额外提供的只是用户索引——事件系统、指针和射线检测器\n所说的都是同一个索引——这样分屏游戏就不必在每个调用点\n重新确认某一块UI属于哪个控制器。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIInputModeLibrary:GetPlayerControllerForUser {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputModeLibrary.h#DreamUIInputModeLibrary:GetPlayerControllerForUser
    src   "The player controller a DreamGUI user index names. Null when there is no such local player."
    text  "DreamGUI用户索引所指的玩家控制器。当不存在这样的本地玩家时为空。"
    state machine
}

