    state machine
}

DreamUIInputModeLibrary:SetInputModeUIOnly {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputModeLibrary.h#DreamUIInputModeLibrary:SetInputModeUIOnly
    src   "Only the UI sees input, and the cursor is shown -- while the player is on the keyboard and mouse:\nwith UDreamGUISettings::bHideCursorOnGamepad, DreamGUI hides it while they use a pad and shows it\nagain when they go back to the mouse, for as long as this mode holds.\n\nThe engine's UI-only mode ignores input at the game viewport client, and DreamGUI's input arrives\nbehind it, so DreamGUI hears nothing in it unless the client is UDreamGameViewportClient (or\nderives from it): that client routes the input on while this mode holds, and holds the player's\nmovement and look input still. With any other client a warning says so once.\n@param InWidgetToFocus       Optional. Focused through UDreamWidget::SetFocus, which is DreamGUI's\n                                                     equivalent of the Slate widget UMG's version takes."
    text  "只有UI能看到输入，并显示光标——前提是玩家正在使用键盘和鼠标：\n启用UDreamGUISettings::bHideCursorOnGamepad时，DreamGUI会在玩家使用手柄期间隐藏光标，\n并在其回到鼠标时再次显示，只要该模式持续有效。\n\n引擎的仅UI模式会在游戏视口客户端处忽略输入，而DreamGUI的输入在其后到达，\n因此DreamGUI在该模式下什么也收不到，除非客户端是UDreamGameViewportClient（或\n由其派生）：该客户端会在该模式持续期间转发输入，并让玩家的\n移动和视角输入保持静止。使用其他客户端时会给出一次警告。\n@param InWidgetToFocus       可选。通过UDreamWidget::SetFocus设置焦点，它是DreamGUI对\n                                                     UMG版本所接收的Slate控件的等价形式。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIInputModeLibrary:SetMouseLockMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputModeLibrary.h#DreamUIInputModeLibrary:SetMouseLockMode
    src   "Lock the cursor to the viewport (or stop locking it) without changing the input mode.\n\nSeparate because the two are separate decisions: a game can want the cursor confined while still\nrouting input to both halves, and re-setting the whole input mode to change only the lock is how\na project accidentally takes focus away from its own menu."
    text  "在不改变输入模式的情况下，将光标锁定到视口（或取消锁定）。\n\n之所以分开，是因为这是两个独立的决定：游戏可能希望限制光标范围，同时仍\n将输入路由到两方；而为了只改变锁定状态就重新设置整个输入模式，正是\n项目意外夺走自身菜单焦点的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIInputModeLibrary:SetShowMouseCursor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputModeLibrary.h#DreamUIInputModeLibrary:SetShowMouseCursor
    src   "Show or hide the hardware cursor for a player."
    text  "显示或隐藏玩家的硬件光标。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIInputMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputModeLibrary.h#EDreamUIInputMode
    src   "Who is listening to the mouse and the keys: the game, the UI, or both.\n\nThe same three states UMG offers through UWidgetBlueprintLibrary::SetInputMode_*, because a project\nusing DreamGUI needs them for exactly the same reasons -- open a menu and the camera should stop\nfollowing the mouse; close it and it should start again -- and having to reach for the UMG library\nto get them is how a project ends up with two half-answers."
    text  "谁在接收鼠标和键盘的输入：游戏、UI，还是两者。\n\n它与UMG的控件蓝图库通过UWidgetBlueprintLibrary::SetInputMode_*提供的三种状态相同，因为使用DreamGUI\n的项目需要它们的原因完全相同——打开菜单后相机应停止跟随鼠标；\n关闭菜单后应重新跟随——而为了获得这些状态不得不去调用UMG库，\n正是一个项目最终得到两套半吊子答案的原因。"
    state machine
}

